# scenes on the Arrange page: a second scene cloned, a mute, a cue while playing, the song
wait 200
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
expect scene 2
wait 40
shot scene2.png
tapkey b0
wait 40
shot scene2_mute.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
tapkey w0
wait 40
shot scene_cue.png
wait 2500
tap PLAY
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w1
wait 40
shot song_slots.png
tap SEL
wait 40
shot song_list.png
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot song_playing.png
tap PLAY
